      "source": [
        "## 9. Configuración Personalizada (custom_config.yml)\n",
        "\n",
        "### Crear Archivo Personalizado:\n",
        "```yaml\n",
        "# custom_config.yml en tu directorio de trabajo\n",
        "camera:\n",
        "  background_color: \"#000000\"        # Fondo negro\n",
        "  fps: 60                           # 60 FPS\n",
        "\n",
        "window:\n",
        "  position_string: \"OO\"             # Centro de pantalla\n",
        "  full_screen: true                 # Pantalla completa\n",
        "\n",
        "scene:\n",
        "  default_wait_time: 0.5            # Pausas más cortas\n",
        "\n",
        "colors:\n",
        "  mi_color: \"#FF6B6B\"              # Color personalizado\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "### Usar Configuración Personalizada:\n",
        "```bash\n",
        "# Usar custom_config.yml del directorio actual\n",
        "manimgl archivo.py Escena\n",
        "\n",
        "# Usar archivo específico\n",
        "manimgl archivo.py Escena --config_file mi_config.yml\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "### Configuración por Escena:\n",
        "```python\n",
        "class MiEscena(Scene):\n",
        "    # Configuración específica de la escena\n",
        "    default_camera_config = {\n",
        "        \"background_color\": \"#FF0000\"\n",
        "    }\n",
        "    \n",
        "    def construct(self):\n",
        "        # Tu código aquí\n",
        "        pass\n",
        "```\n"
      ]
    },
